hML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">N</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, the eigenvalues of both\nperturbed matrices exactly, and the distance each eigenvalue\ntravels.</p>","file":"ch12-spectral-theory/11-defect-from-normality.html"}